# 白名单仓库：默认忽略一切，只放行下面列出的文件。
# 关键：lll.conf / *.conf / *.bak 一律排除 —— lll.conf 里有
#       MITM CA 私钥口令（ca-passphrase / ca-p12）与机场订阅 token。
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!AI-OpenAI.list
!AI-Claude.list
!AI-Gemini.list
!AI-Copilot.list
!AI-Jetbrains.list
!AI-Overseas-Others.list
!AI-Supplement-OpenAI.list
!AI-Supplement-Claude.list
!AI-Supplement-Gemini.list
!AI-Supplement.list
!AI-CN.list
!AI-Supplement-CN.list
!refresh-ai-lists.sh
!sync.sh
# GitHub Actions 工作流（嵌套路径需逐层放行父目录）
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/generate.yml
!check-ai-lists.sh
!check-novel.sh
!check-liveness.sh
!check-brand-isolation.sh
